// The typed file-source echo `<type>"path"` was removed 2026-10-24 — the
// tag is declared once on the parameter (`source: Source[kind]`) and the
// invocation is `@"path"`. PARSE001 teaches the migration.
~[comptime|transform]tor render.file { source: Source[text], program: *const Program, allocator: std.mem.Allocator }
| transformed *const Program
| failed string

~render.file <text>"hello.txt"
| transformed _ |> _
